    "text": "The minimum value of the twice differentiable function&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math>, is",
